{'symbol': 'BA', 'date': '2020-04-11 20:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Triumph Furloughed About 2,300 Employees In U.S., Europe To Reduce Capacity Related To Boeing Programs', 'text': "TRIUMPH GROUP - FURLOUGHED ABOUT 2,300 EMPLOYEES ACROSS PLANTS IN U.S., EUROPE FOR 2-4 WEEKS TO REDUCE CAPACITY RELATED TO BOEING COMMERCIAL AIRCRAFT PROGRAMS.TRIUMPH GROUP - TO PROVIDE 1 WEEK OF COMPANY PAY, TO COVER EMPLOYEE SHARE OF MEDICAL PREMIUMS DURING FURLOUGH PERIOD.TRIUMPH GROUP - WILL ELIMINATE ABOUT 200 FULL-TIME POSITIONS DUE TO DECREASED DEMAND.TRIUMPH GROUP - TO PAY SEVERANCE TO IMPACTED EMPLOYEES CONSISTENT WITH EXISTING POLICIES.TRIUMPH GROUP INC -  EMPLOYEE REDUCTIONS ARE EXPECTED TO BE COMPLETED BY MAY 1.TRIUMPH GROUP - ALL BUT TWO OF TRIUMPH'S FACTORIES ARE OPERATIONAL."}{'symbol': 'BA', 'date': '2020-04-11 18:30:00-04:56', 'title': "Moody's Downgrades Boeing's Senior Unsecured Rating To Baa2", 'text': "MOODY'S DOWNGRADES BOEING'S SENIOR UNSECURED RATING TO BAA2, OUTLOOK TO NEGATIVE."}{'symbol': 'BA', 'date': '2020-04-11 01:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Boeing Considers Potential 10% Cut To Workforce - WSJ', 'text': ':BOEING CONSIDERS POTENTIAL 10% CUT TO WORKFORCE'}{'symbol': 'CAG', 'date': '2020-04-11 17:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'USDA Food Safety & Inspection Service Says Conagra Brands Recalls About 130,763 Pounds Of Frozen Not-Ready-To-Eat Chicken Bowl Products', 'text': "USDA FOOD SAFETY & INSPECTION SERVICE - CONAGRA BRANDS RECALLS FROZEN NOT-READY-TO-EAT CHICKEN BOWL PRODUCTS DUE TO POSSIBLE FOREIGN MATTER CONTAMINATION.USDA FOOD SAFETY & INSPECTION SERVICE - IDENTIFIES CONAGRA BRANDS' FROZEN NOT-READY-TO-EAT CHICKEN BOWL PRODUCTS RECALL AS CLASS I RECALL.USDA FOOD SAFETY & INSPECTION SERVICE - CONAGRA BRANDS IS RECALLING ABOUT 130,763 POUNDS OF NOT READY-TO-EAT CHICKEN BOWL PRODUCTS."}{'symbol': 'ETR', 'date': '2020-04-11 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Entergy Corporation Gives Evening Restoration Update For Apr. 10', 'text': 'ENTERGY-THUNDERSTORMS, HIGH WINDS IMPACTED ENTERG